	"tutorialDesc": "The hand-made floors of Chronos Settlement’s dungeons (sim/delveFloors.ts). Paint the Ground (an empty cell is solid rock: the walls are drawn where it meets open ground), put a Room at each room’s middle numbered by `step` in the order the party goes through them (0 the way in; the first after it a fight, the one before the boss a camp, the last the boss), and dress it with Props (low ones like bones and spikes are walked over; the rest stand in the way). After editing, run `node tools/ldtk-maps.mjs` to make src/shared/data/delveFloors.ts.",
